          "math_latex": "4 c - 15",
          "misconception": "Omit a term when distributing or combining like terms."
        }
      ],
      "marks": null,
      "answer": {
        "correct_option_id": "B",
        "correct_option_text": "\\left(3 c^{2} + 4 c\\right) - 15",
        "explanation": "Multiply every term by both terms of the other binomial and combine the middle products."
      },
